      <mxCell id="s20_body1" value="&lt;div style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#202124;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Kernel RLS defeats zero-day prompt jailbreaks&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='height:3px;'&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#5F6368;'&gt;• Challenge: What if an indirect RAG injection bypasses Model Armor and runs SELECT * WHERE 1=1?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#5F6368;'&gt;• Mechanism: AlloyDB ENABLE &amp;amp; FORCE ROW LEVEL SECURITY binds current_setting('app.current_tenant_id') from the KMS JWT.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#5F6368;'&gt;• Proof: 0 foreign disk pages scanned across 10/10 red-team vectors.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#202124;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=16;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
