      <mxCell id="s20_body2" value="&lt;div style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#202124;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.18;'&gt;89.1% token savings with 0 PII in cache&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='height:3px;'&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#5F6368;'&gt;• Challenge: How do 950 tenants share Vertex Context Caching without leaking customer PII across turns?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#5F6368;'&gt;• Mechanism: Immutable &amp;gt;= 32,768-token static prefix holds only system policy &amp;amp; schemas; ARD prunes 94% of unused tools.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#5F6368;'&gt;• Proof: 0.10x cached prefix rate (3,969 eq vs 36,468 raw).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#202124;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=16;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
