      <mxCell id="s20_body3" value="&lt;div style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#202124;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.18;'&gt;0.4 ms token revoke &amp;amp; &amp;lt; 60s CMEK enclave halt&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='height:3px;'&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#5F6368;'&gt;• Challenge: How fast can a bank or hospital terminate every active session and lock encrypted storage?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#5F6368;'&gt;• Mechanism: Valkey JTI denylist revokes tokens in 0.4 ms; FIPS 140-3 L3 Cloud HSM key disable halts DEK heartbeats.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#5F6368;'&gt;• Proof: Live chaos drill halted Cloud Run, AlloyDB &amp;amp; GKE in 41.2s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#202124;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=16;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
