      <mxCell id="s20_body5" value="&lt;div style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#202124;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.18;'&gt;30 / 30 keyless AWS &amp;amp; SaaS MCP federation&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='height:3px;'&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#5F6368;'&gt;• Challenge: How do agents query AWS Bedrock AgentCore and 10 SaaS targets without long-lived IAM keys?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#5F6368;'&gt;• Mechanism: GCP OIDC exchanges for AWS STS WebIdentity + 3LO OBO tokens over 2–5 ms Cross-Cloud Interconnect.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#5F6368;'&gt;• Proof: 10 SaaS × 3 Patterns = 30/30 READY with 0 static keys.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#202124;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=16;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
