      <mxCell id="s20_body6" value="&lt;div style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#202124;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.18;'&gt;99.4% sibling p99 stability under 10k RPM flood&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='height:3px;'&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#B06000;'&gt;• Challenge: Can one runaway tenant loop exhaust Vertex TPM quotas or starve 949 sibling tenants?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#B06000;'&gt;• Mechanism: Atomic Valkey Lua token buckets cap traffic at 120 RPM/user and 600 RPM/tenant in 0.4 ms.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#B06000;'&gt;• Proof: Flooded tenant gets HTTP 429; 949 siblings keep 99.4% SLO.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF7E0;strokeColor=#E37400;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#202124;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=16;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
